    "<p>周一-周日&nbsp; &nbsp;商场10:00- 22:00</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 瑞典风味餐厅&nbsp;&nbsp;10:00- 21:00</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 瑞典特色食品屋及瑞典风味小餐馆&nbsp;&nbsp;10:00 - 22:00</p>"
